\section{Frozen question and verdict}
\textbf{Hypothesis.} \VAR{summary.hypothesis|latex}

The primary endpoint is mean RMSE at 15, 30, and 60 minutes; 5 minutes is an
anchor. A screen candidate advances only if it improves the current custom
candidate, remains numerically stable, and does not worsen coverage distance
or tail MAE beyond the frozen tolerance. Final success still requires at least
2\% improvement plus multi-fold, multi-seed, bootstrap, uncertainty, and
stability evidence.

