\section{Frozen next experiment}
The balanced all-scale concatenation candidate and raw learned Student-t scale
are frozen for three rolling folds and seeds 17, 41, and 73. Persistence,
climatology, diagnostic LightGBM, MLP, TCN, and Horizon v1 remain honest
controls. Confirmation stays sealed unless the unchanged rolling gates make
the candidate eligible. The exact next-cycle protocol is
\texttt{\VAR{summary.next_protocol|latex}}.

\section{Limitations and claim boundary}
This is a single-site selection screen with capped examples and one seed. The
small point gain is not confirmation, universal superiority, operational
readiness, or evidence of causal atmospheric regimes. Component weights are
diagnostics only. The correct claim is narrower: the implementation is
reproducible, the complete screen is negative/partial, and balanced Fusion v2
merits the already frozen robustness characterization.

